<title>USA: MEHL/Biophile names Wilson as CFO.</title>
<headline>MEHL/Biophile names Wilson as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GAINESVILLE, Fla. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MEHL/Biophile International Corp said it has named Raymond Wilson to the position of vice president-finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wilson has recently functioned as vice president-finance for Sonoco Products Co unit Engraph Inc, a $300 million international manufacturer of packaging and other identification material for consumer products companies.</p>
